{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\TimeTracker\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-missing",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/AppInfo/Application.php:13 OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\Mapper: Nextcloud 25 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 35; Move over to QBMapper"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 use in 1 file of the public API that a major of Nextcloud 31 to 35 no longer has. The app fails there where it comes to that line, or the server no longer calls the method it overrides.",
        "  lib/AppInfo/Application.php:13 OCP\\AppFramework\\Db\\Mapper: Nextcloud 25 is the last major to have it, the app declares up to 35; Move over to QBMapper"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "route-target-missing",
