      "places": [
        "POST /index.php/apps/timetracker/echo  timetracker.page.do_echo  appinfo/routes.php:15 routes: OCA\\TimeTracker\\Controller\\PageController has no method doEcho()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "1 route names a controller class or a method that does not exist, or a method that is not public. A request to such a route ends in an error.",
